OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer who misled police over
OL,4,Aex-partner is fired
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police misconduct panel found an
OL,7,Fofficer deliberately misled senior
OL,8,Fcolleagues about her links to a former
OL,9,Fpartner and his convicted criminal
OL,10,Fbrother.
OL,12,FThe Cambridgeshire officer previously
OL,13,Freported being a victim of domestic
OL,14,Fabuse by her ex and said she was forced
OL,15,Fto help conceal evidence linked to a
OL,16,Fserious offence committed by his
OL,17,Fbrother.
